---
import GardenLayout from '../layouts/GardenLayout.astro';
---

<GardenLayout title="About" description="About Aaron Oswald">
  <article class="prose">
    <header class="mb-12 not-prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">
        About Me
      </h1>
    </header>

    <h2>What I Do</h2>
    <p>
      I'm a Data Analysis Manager at Capital One, specializing in the wild world of debit cards,
      from the moment they're printed to the moment you're asking for a refund from the gym that
      scammed you.
    </p>

    <h2>How I Got Here</h2>
    <p>
      I was an innocent 23-year-old at a career fair, specializing in robotics, when I realized:
      "I'm good at using data to move expensive robot arms around, but what if I'm also good at
      using data to help move a large part of the world's consumer finance system around?"
    </p>

    <h2>What I Build</h2>
    <p>
      I've been building spreadsheets and data visualizations all my life to get a better grasp on
      it, but AI coding agents have given me a chance to turn these into actual apps that other
      people can use. They're on the <a href="/projects">projects page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What I Do to My Body</h2>
    <p>
      I ran an 850-mile bike trip around Iceland. I've summited Mount Whitney. I did the
      Dolomites, and I did the "Athens, Marathon. The Authentic" successfully!
    </p>

    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:Redoswald@gmail.com">Email</a> ·
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/aaronoswald" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</GardenLayout>
